WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Open the focus line.
Start in My Day. Your focus opens the planning session.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:16.800 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Describe a useful outcome.
Use your own words — not a list of commands.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:23.067 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Build a draft, not a commitment.
Work OS turns your note into a plan for review.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:28.133 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Read what you are confirming.
Check the goal and proposed work before the final action.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:37.083 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Confirm the plan yourself.
Confirm my day saves the reviewed plan. It does not clock you in.
